<%doc>

=head1 NAME 
qtl/waitmessage.mas - wait message while solqtl is running

=AUTHOR
Isaak Y Tecle (iyt2@cornell.edu)

=cut

</%doc> 
 
<div id    ="waitmsg" 
       style ="display:none; 
              color:#f87431; 
              font-weight: bold; 
              font-style:italic; 
              background-color:#fff;
              width:200px;
              word-wrap:break-word;
              ">   
    <pre>solQTL 正在運行中(solQTL is running) ..... 
                請稍候(Please wait) ..... 
                       這可能需要(This may take) 
                            幾分鐘(a few minutes)。
    </pre>
  </div>      
